{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Bounce items to new track\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This script renders all selected media items across multiple tracks into a single combined file on a new track below the lowest involved track.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Key Features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Flexible signal flow:} Options to toggle track FX and take FX on/off.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Pre-fader rendering:} "Ignore track Vol/Pan" bypasses track volume, pan, mute, and solo states.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Smart mono:} Allows generating a true 1-channel file.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Safety First:} The "Delete source tracks" function is a separate undo step. Press undo once to restore tracks, press again to remove the bounce.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Memory:} The script remembers last used settings (checkbox states).\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Troubleshooting:} Saves detailed operation logs in the relevant project folder.\sa180\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
{\colortbl;\red255\green0\blue0;\red0\green0\blue255;}
\widowctrl\hyphauto

{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 DAWproject for REAPER\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 This script imports DAWproject files into the open REAPER project and exports REAPER projects in the DAWproject format.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Key Features\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Two-way transfer:} Import DAWproject files into REAPER or export the current project.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Project structure:} Transfers tracks, folders, media items, markers, tempo and time signature changes, and supported automation.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Audio editing:} Preserves supported item splits, overlaps, fades, crossfades, playback rates, and stretch markers.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Plug-ins and routing:} Transfers supported plug-in data and track routing between compatible DAWs.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 \bullet \tx360\tab {\b Troubleshooting:} Saves detailed operation logs in the relevant project folder.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 The data available after import depends on how each DAW implements the DAWproject format.\par}
}

{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}{\f1 \fmodern Courier;}}
