{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel0 \b \fs36 Reach the Knob \u8212- REAPER Scripts\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 A collection of Lua scripts and tools for {\b REAPER}, created by Alex Gurev of {\b Reach the Knob}. Scripts can be installed individually or via {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://reapack.com"}}{\fldrslt{\ul
ReaPack
}}}
.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Installation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Via ReaPack\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Open REAPER \u8594 ? Extensions \u8594 ? ReaPack \u8594 ? Import repository.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Paste the repository URL: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/AlexGurev/RtK-reascripts/refs/heads/main/index.xml\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Refresh packages and install the scripts you want.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel2 \b \fs28 Manual Installation\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 1.\tx360\tab Download the {\f1 .lua} files from this repository.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 2.\tx360\tab Place them in your REAPER scripts folder.\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa0 \li360 \fi-360 3.\tx360\tab Refresh REAPER actions list.\sa180\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 \outlinelevel1 \b \fs32 Contributing\par}
{\pard \ql \f0 \sa180 \li0 \fi0 If you want to contribute or suggest improvements, feel free to open an issue or pull request.\par}
